  "notes": "Butler County (State Auditor), cash basis, FY ended June 30, 2024. Statement p4 Total Governmental Funds column; beginning/ending are cash basis fund balances. ending_investments 12,737,287 (p3) is informational and already inside ending cash. Balance sheet: Statement of Cash Basis Assets and Fund Balances - Governmental Funds (p3) Total column; totals equal the p1 Statement of Net Position. Taxes: Other split by fund name (Visitors Promotion/Improvement funds = lodging tax), remainder kept as printed Other taxes. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5-6), its Taxes line 5,351,315 split using the p4 General Fund column (budget 5,415,299 is for the whole line, so budget_final null on the pieces); major funds Road, Inheritance, Special Road (p7-8); nonmajor funds via Total Nonmajor Funds column of the combining statement (p15-18) since there are more than 6 funds; per-fund nonmajor budget schedules (p9-14) not recorded to avoid double counting. Inheritance Fund had no disbursements. Read pages 1-18 of 18"
